# The published Noise test vector for Noise_XX_25519_ChaChaPoly_SHA256, converted from JSON
# to this directory's `key = value` form. Nothing was changed but the layout.
#
# Source: cacophony, vectors/cacophony.txt, the one entry whose protocol_name is
# Noise_XX_25519_ChaChaPoly_SHA256 (no PSK, no fallback).
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haskell-cryptography/cacophony/master/vectors/cacophony.txt
#   read 2026-09-30; file sha256 3bde7c09a6f349ee11c825c50fcc02649f8f02a47c857a459206b357f9386cae;
#   last commit touching it 18b7348c54fd61fcd0c220298883de0d09c8364d. Licence: Unlicense.
#
# Keys are X25519 private keys; public keys are derived. Messages 0 to 2 are the handshake
# (-> e; <- e, ee, s, es; -> s, se); 3 to 5 are transport messages. Senders alternate
# starting with the initiator, so 3 and 5 are responder to initiator and 4 is initiator to
# responder. Transport messages use empty associated data.

